{"title": "Titan Weapon", "pageid": 28071, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Titan_Weapon", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Titan Weapon</b> is a passive feature that adds your Strength modifier to your ranged weapon attacks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This weapon deals additional damage equal to your <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Modifier\">Modifier</a>. \n</p><p>The weapon only adds the modifier if it improves your chance to hit.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Titanstring_Bow\" title=\"Titanstring Bow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Titanstring_Bow\" title=\"Titanstring Bow\">Titanstring Bow</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><b>Titan Weapon</b> adds a minimum of +1 to the damage roll, even if the attacker has a <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> of 11 or lower.\n<ul><li>The bonus damage is in addition to the normal <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> bonus for ranged weapons.</li>\n<li>The bonus damage can be applied <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_rider_as_source\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage rider as source\">multiple times</a> to a single ranged weapon attack. For example, special <a href=\"/wiki/Arrows\" title=\"Arrows\">arrows</a> with additional damage will receive the bonus to its additional damage, e.g. the additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span> damage from <a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Ilmater\" title=\"Arrow of Ilmater\">Arrow of Ilmater</a> will also receive bonus <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span> damage equal to your Strength modifier. Another example is a rogue's <a href=\"/wiki/Sneak_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak Attack\">Sneak Attack</a> when used as a reaction.\n<ul><li>This is mostly changed in <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>, but the bonus damage can still apply to special arrows.</li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li>The bonus damage applies to most <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Shots\" title=\"Arcane Shots\">Arcane Shots</a>. Notably, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Shot:_Seeking_Arrow\" title=\"Arcane Shot: Seeking Arrow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Arcane_Shot_Seeking_Arrow_Icon.webp/20px-Arcane_Shot_Seeking_Arrow_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Arcane_Shot_Seeking_Arrow_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Shot_Seeking_Arrow_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Arcane_Shot_Seeking_Arrow_Icon.webp/40px-Arcane_Shot_Seeking_Arrow_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Shot: Seeking Arrow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Arcane_Shot_Seeking_Arrow_Icon.webp/20px-Arcane_Shot_Seeking_Arrow_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Arcane_Shot_Seeking_Arrow_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Shot:_Seeking_Arrow\" title=\"Arcane Shot: Seeking Arrow\">Arcane Shot: Seeking Arrow</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Shot:_Piercing_Arrow\" title=\"Arcane Shot: Piercing Arrow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/da/Arcane_Shot_Piercing_Arrow_Icon.webp/20px-Arcane_Shot_Piercing_Arrow_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/da/Arcane_Shot_Piercing_Arrow_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Shot_Piercing_Arrow_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/da/Arcane_Shot_Piercing_Arrow_Icon.webp/40px-Arcane_Shot_Piercing_Arrow_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Shot: Piercing Arrow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/da/Arcane_Shot_Piercing_Arrow_Icon.webp/20px-Arcane_Shot_Piercing_Arrow_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/da/Arcane_Shot_Piercing_Arrow_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Shot:_Piercing_Arrow\" title=\"Arcane Shot: Piercing Arrow\">Arcane Shot: Piercing Arrow</a> do not apply the bonus damage due to the lack of attack rolls for these actions.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Titan Weapon has an extra description that states \"The weapon only adds the modifier if it improves your chance to hit.\" but this has no actual function/relevance.</li>\n<li>The bonus damage from Strength is not reflected on the character sheet or <i>Ranged Attack</i> tooltip.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714214634\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1381/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 14656/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7699/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.014/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 928650/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.370      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   38.370      1 -total\n 49.30%   18.915      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 38.56%   14.796      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 36.14%   13.866      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 18.30%    7.020      1 Template:Item_icon\n 14.43%    5.538      2 Template:SmSAI\n 10.49%    4.025      1 Template:PageSeo\n  9.61%    3.688      2 Template:Icon_link\n  9.22%    3.536     14 Template:Trim\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28071-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714214634 and revision id 395300. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}